		{"id":"4d3c2235bdc16103","type":"text","text":"#### Attached Bottle Caps","x":3860,"y":590,"width":232,"height":61,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6d2399d48df0edae","type":"file","file":"Semester 2/Interface Design/Tasks/Challenge 1/attachments/Screenshot 2026-03-14 161400.png","x":2670,"y":694,"width":355,"height":198},
		{"id":"34c1437c51d48b87","type":"file","file":"Semester 2/Interface Design/Tasks/Challenge 1/attachments/ScreenShot-2026-03-07_22-11-09-B7E.jpg","x":4501,"y":-962,"width":400,"height":225},
		{"id":"3eb90b3e528dfaf0","type":"text","text":"- Play & Immersion\n- Desktop Game (Space Sim)\n\n\n","x":5398,"y":-654,"width":280,"height":79,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"115efc4968793878","type":"text","text":"*Disclaimer: Star Citizen is in active development. I’m analyzing the UI of the current state of the game, which is less than stellar.*\n**Effectiveness / Efficiency**\nMost UI elements are clunky, slow, and utilize 3D elements for no other reason than to look futuristic. \nContrast between UI and Environment is often bad. \nImportant UI elements are often not in the forwards view of the player. \nShip UI requires mouse interaction.\nThere is little visual and auditory feedback for actions.\nActions are slow, and often don’t succeed.\n**Satisfaction**\nNot very satisfying\n**Learnability / Memorability**\nSteep learning curve, there is little help, many functions are not where they’re expected\n**Safety**\nThere isn’t any.\n\n\n","x":5240,"y":-1362,"width":438,"height":513,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"8f4a9f1b7c3634fa","type":"file","file":"Semester 2/Interface Design/Tasks/Challenge 1/attachments/ScreenShot-2026-02-01_18-14-38-BC0.jpg","x":4575,"y":-1235,"width":400,"height":225},
		{"id":"c014867393da93f0","type":"text","text":"## The Bad","x":2880,"y":-5,"width":200,"height":72,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"4ba0e35c6d0c0575","type":"text","text":"**Effectiveness / Efficiency**\nThe interface is effective at setting up the mouse, but isn’t very efficient, due to slow load times and unreliability, often requiring manual restarts through task manager to get working again.\n**Satisfaction**\nNot satisfying. Wait times are often in the seconds when using the features like Shortcuts\n**Learnability / Memorability**\nIt’s pretty intuitive and easy to understand.\n**Safety**\nThere isn’t much to go wrong when using it.\n\n\n\n","x":3080,"y":607,"width":438,"height":331,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"5877bb82a3150569","type":"text","text":"#### Logi Options +","x":2740,"y":460,"width":188,"height":50,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"cc445d52c278f154","type":"file","file":"Semester 2/Interface Design/Tasks/Challenge 1/attachments/Screenshot 2026-03-14 161328.png","x":2440,"y":946,"width":358,"height":202},
		{"id":"4c9496365d47b5bc","type":"text","text":"- Information & Service\n- Desktop","x":2420,"y":455,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"0dab25192299bf90","type":"file","file":"Semester 2/Interface Design/Tasks/Challenge 1/attachments/Screenshot 2026-03-14 161759.png","x":2422,"y":616,"width":171,"height":156},
		{"id":"1f60f25e4b9be2a8","type":"text","text":"#### Star Citizen","x":4215,"y":-625,"width":250,"height":50,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"db25aacdf6917d84","type":"text","text":"#### Outlook","x":4176,"y":235,"width":250,"height":57,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"f20abb54ef0e8e31","type":"file","file":"Semester 2/Interface Design/Tasks/Challenge 1/attachments/Pasted image 20260314183456.png","x":4701,"y":-246,"width":400,"height":241},
		{"id":"2055d2d82748405b","type":"text","text":"- Information & Service\n- Desktop / Web\n\n\n","x":4600,"y":253,"width":280,"height":79,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"3a3d3b34928eff48","type":"text","text":"**Effectiveness / Efficiency**\nOutlook loads slowly in general\n**Satisfaction**\nNot very satisfying to use\nisn’t pretty\n**Learnability / Memorability**\nCluttered interface, makes it hard to view and figure out all features \n**Safety**\nActions can easily be undone.\n\n\n","x":4207,"y":-165,"width":438,"height":280,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"4bf98edb852b0a39","type":"text","text":"GIMP","x":2475,"y":-815,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"85b5100587bdf671","type":"text","text":"**Effectiveness / Efficiency**\nIf you’re not used to GIMP;\nIt’s very slow to find out where to even adjust and do things!\n**Satisfaction**\nI feel terrible using GIMP.\n**Learnability / Memorability**\nIt’s very convoluted and messy.\n**Safety**\nNot a lot, as there is no non-destructive editing.\n\n","x":2400,"y":-1105,"width":499,"height":250,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"e3dc420412c032c9","type":"text","text":"- Creation & Operation\n- Desktop","x":2899,"y":-815,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"a61ec0b3a0ae6d24","type":"file","file":"Semester 2/Interface Design/Tasks/Challenge 1/attachments/Pasted image 20260314163514.png","x":805,"y":-489,"width":91,"height":197},
		{"id":"18517ab3b87701dd","type":"file","file":"Semester 2/Interface Design/Tasks/Challenge 1/attachments/Pasted image 20260314163522.png","x":925,"y":-488,"width":91,"height":197},
		{"id":"5bf2812bc1d7300b","type":"file","file":"Semester 2/Interface Design/Tasks/Challenge 1/attachments/Pasted image 20260314163510.png","x":806,"y":-940,"width":91,"height":197},
		{"id":"9f0b1f2f0dd52219","type":"file","file":"Semester 2/Interface Design/Tasks/Challenge 1/attachments/Pasted image 20260314163517.png","x":683,"y":-489,"width":91,"height":197},
		{"id":"8656c26f22635e4b","type":"file","file":"Semester 2/Interface Design/Tasks/Challenge 1/attachments/Pasted image 20260314163503.png","x":684,"y":-940,"width":91,"height":197},
		{"id":"d14033701f0e16bf","type":"text","text":"- Consumption & Lifestyle\n- Mobile","x":1095,"y":-360,"width":250,"height":69,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"144d369193cc0cbb","type":"link","url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/820395003821686874/1482428862204870687/image.png?ex=69b6eaf6&is=69b59976&hm=9e34b4ec9fbc1407ab665f3a4545c61fe8ad5b8654689bdaad2e9313f876aeba&","x":3088,"y":-1067,"width":140,"height":212},
		{"id":"98dad4a867cfb0dc","type":"file","file":"Semester 2/Interface Design/Tasks/Challenge 1/attachments/Pasted image 20260314182234.png","x":2828,"y":-1346,"width":400,"height":215},
		{"id":"d5e94bd2522d8ea6","type":"file","file":"Semester 2/Interface Design/Tasks/Challenge 1/attachments/Pasted image 20260314181648.png","x":2400,"y":-1345,"width":399,"height":214},
		{"id":"85eae09ab6dd1adf","type":"file","file":"Semester 2/Interface Design/Tasks/Challenge 1/attachments/Pasted image 20260314163527.png","x":926,"y":-940,"width":91,"height":197},
		{"id":"92b008c15874fed3","type":"text","text":"**Effectiveness / Efficiency**\nGood. Most important functions are at most one or two clicks away and there is minimal delay.\n**Satisfaction**\nEasy to use, beautiful design\n**Learnability / Memorability**\nEverything is pretty clearly labeled and has iconography. Some Features like Automix might need some introduction first, but are easily memorized after.\n**Safety**\n“Dangerous” functions like removing albums require confirmation.\nthere’s also the system wide “shake to undo” on iOS, which works with apple Music\n\n","x":1065,"y":-940,"width":310,"height":480,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d41a72457807790c","type":"text","text":"#### Apple Music","x":727,"y":-660,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1"}
